{"id":"417234c094222017","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-gandy.md","title":"Gandy–Woodin Function Characterization","display":"thm-gandy — Gandy–Woodin Function Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-gandy","aliases":["58-thm-gandy"],"display":"thm-gandy — Gandy–Woodin Function Characterization","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-woodin.md]]","[[../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-gandy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-gandy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gandy — Gandy–Woodin Function Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da3159c0c219916e\" href=\"?note=da3159c0c219916e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-woodin.md\">../batch08/58-df-woodin.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0d480b0822a231c2\" href=\"?note=0d480b0822a231c2\" title=\"../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md\">../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md\">../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\in V\">\\(\\delta\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\delta^\\delta\">\\(f\\in\\delta^\\delta\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\">\\(\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\)</span>（Woodin 基数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"da3159c0c219916e\" href=\"?note=da3159c0c219916e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-woodin.md\">../batch08/58-df-woodin.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}\">\\(\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}\\)</span> 是元层类量词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,j\">\\(M,j\\)</span> 是类变元而不是集合变元</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(j;\\mathbf V,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(j;\\mathbf V,M)\\)</span>（类初等嵌入模式，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0d480b0822a231c2\" href=\"?note=0d480b0822a231c2\" title=\"../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md\">../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\alpha\\)</span>（累积层级的集合值类项，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md\">../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}(j)\\)</span>（临界点）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gandy}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\to\n\\forall f\\in\\delta^\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}M,j\\;\n\\Bigl(\nf^{\\prime\\prime}\\kappa\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land M\\subseteq\\mathbf V\n\\land\\forall y\\in M\\;\\forall x\\in y\\;(x\\in M)\n\\land\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(j;\\mathbf V,M)\n\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\n\\land V_{j(f)(\\kappa)}\\subseteq M\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gandy}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\to\n\\forall f\\in\\delta^\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}M,j\\;\n\\Bigl(\nf^{\\prime\\prime}\\kappa\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land M\\subseteq\\mathbf V\n\\land\\forall y\\in M\\;\\forall x\\in y\\;(x\\in M)\n\\land\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(j;\\mathbf V,M)\n\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\n\\land V_{j(f)(\\kappa)}\\subseteq M\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是 Woodin 性的函数—嵌入刻画：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 闭合，并由嵌入见证足够强的闭包。</li>\n<li>目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 与嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:\\mathbf V\\to M\">\\(j:\\mathbf V\\to M\\)</span> 是元理论中的类；集合编码结构谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span> 不能接受真类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf V\">\\(\\mathbf V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>仅要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(\\operatorname{crit}(j))&gt;\\lambda\">\\(j(\\operatorname{crit}(j))&gt;\\lambda\\)</span> 会丢失参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 与目标模型闭包，远不足以刻画 Woodin 基数。</li>\n<li>本原子采用大基数语境中的 Gandy–Woodin 刻画，不是描述集合论中的 Gandy 基定理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-woodin.md","status":"resolved","id":"da3159c0c219916e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-woodin.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md","status":"resolved","id":"0d480b0822a231c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-woodin.md","status":"resolved","id":"da3159c0c219916e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)$（Woodin 基数谓词，见 [[../batch08/58-df-woodin.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md","status":"resolved","id":"0d480b0822a231c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(j;\\mathbf V,M)$（类初等嵌入模式，见 [[../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V_\\alpha$（累积层级的集合值类项，见 [[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\delta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\delta^\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}","display":false},{"tex":"M,j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(j;\\mathbf V,M)","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{crit}(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gandy}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\to\n\\forall f\\in\\delta^\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}M,j\\;\n\\Bigl(\nf^{\\prime\\prime}\\kappa\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land M\\subseteq\\mathbf V\n\\land\\forall y\\in M\\;\\forall x\\in y\\;(x\\in M)\n\\land\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(j;\\mathbf V,M)\n\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\n\\land V_{j(f)(\\kappa)}\\subseteq M\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"j:\\mathbf V\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf V","display":false},{"tex":"j(\\operatorname{crit}(j))>\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1857,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4172","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-thm-gandy.md|58-thm-gandy]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["da3159c0c219916e","0d480b0822a231c2","aabdf3005231e9dc"]}